  "bodyHash": "Tqd5kf68+Is=",
  "content": "<div style=\"color:#ccc;background-color:#1f1f1f;font-family:Consolas, &amp;#x27;font-weight:normal;font-size:14px;line-height:19px\">\n<h2><span style=\"color:#569cd6;font-weight:bold\">工具、盔甲與盾牌</span></h2>\n<span style=\"color:#ccc\">一款貼近原版的 Fabric 模組，大幅擴展你的生存與地形改造能力。&nbsp;</span>\n<div><span style=\"color:#ccc\">本計畫將五個獨立模組整合為單一、連貫的模組，</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#ccc\">引入基於紫水晶、綠寶石與黑曜石的新裝備階層，</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#ccc\">以及強大的多區塊挖掘工具與獨特自訂盾牌。</span></div>\n</div><div style=\"color:#ccc;background-color:#1f1f1f;font-family:Consolas, &amp;#x27;font-weight:normal;font-size:14px;line-height:19px\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"color:#ccc;background-color:#1f1f1f;font-family:Consolas, &amp;#x27;font-weight:normal;font-size:14px;line-height:19px\"><br>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#569cd6;font-weight:bold\">重型工具（錘子與挖掘鏟）</span></h2>\n<span style=\"color:#ccc\">錘子作為升級版鎬子，用於挖掘石頭類材料；</span></div><div style=\"color:#ccc;background-color:#1f1f1f;font-family:Consolas, &amp;#x27;font-weight:normal;font-size:14px;line-height:19px\"><span style=\"color:#ccc\">挖掘鏟則作為升級版鏟子，用於挖掘泥土、沙子和礫石。</span></div><div style=\"color:#ccc;background-color:#1f1f1f;font-family:Consolas, &amp;#x27;font-weight:normal;font-size:14px;line-height:19px\"><span style=\"color:#ccc\">兩種工具皆可同時挖掘多個方塊，並配備動態視覺方塊輪廓，</span></div><div style=\"color:#ccc;background-color:#1f1f1f;font-family:Consolas, &amp;#x27;font-weight:normal;font-size:14px;line-height:19px\"><span style=\"color:#ccc\">精確顯示挖掘前將被破壞的方塊。</span><br>\n<div><span style=\"color:#ccc\">工具分為四個階層，各有不同的挖掘半徑與深度：</span></div>\n<br>\n<div><span style=\"color:#6796e6\">-</span><span style=\"color:#ccc\"> </span><span style=\"color:#569cd6;font-weight:bold\">鐵質階層</span><span style=\"color:#ccc\">：挖掘 </span><span style=\"color:#569cd6;font-weight:bold\">3x3x1</span><span style=\"color:#ccc\"> 區域（1 格深）。</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#6796e6\">-</span><span style=\"color:#ccc\"> </span><span style=\"color:#569cd6;font-weight:bold\">紅石階層</span><span style=\"color:#ccc\">：挖掘 </span><span style=\"color:#569cd6;font-weight:bold\">3x3x3</span><span style=\"color:#ccc\"> 區域（3 格深）。</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#6796e6\">-</span><span style=\"color:#ccc\"> </span><span style=\"color:#569cd6;font-weight:bold\">綠寶石階層</span><span style=\"color:#ccc\">：挖掘巨大 </span><span style=\"color:#569cd6;font-weight:bold\">5x5x1</span><span style=\"color:#ccc\"> 區域（1 格深）。</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#6796e6\">-</span><span style=\"color:#ccc\"> </span><span style=\"color:#569cd6;font-weight:bold\">鑽石階層</span><span style=\"color:#ccc\">：挖掘終極 </span><span style=\"color:#569cd6;font-weight:bold\">5x5x5</span><span style=\"color:#ccc\"> 區域（5 格深）。</span></div>\n<br>\n<div><span style=\"color:#ccc;font-style:italic\">_備註：工具會動態跳過不適合挖掘的方塊</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#ccc;font-style:italic\">（例如挖掘鏟不會破壞石頭），避免意外破壞你的世界。_</span></div>\n</div><div style=\"color:#ccc;background-color:#1f1f1f;font-family:Consolas, &amp;#x27;font-weight:normal;font-size:14px;line-height:19px\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"color:#ccc;background-color:#1f1f1f;font-family:Consolas, &amp;#x27;font-weight:normal;font-size:14px;line-height:19px\"><br>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#569cd6;font-weight:bold\">階層與盔甲套裝加成</span></h2>\n<span style=\"color:#ccc\">本模組為三種材料引入完整的工具組、武器與盔甲：&nbsp;</span>\n<div><span style=\"color:#ccc\">紫水晶、綠寶石與黑曜石。</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#ccc\">穿戴全套盔甲可獲得獨特、持續的能力：</span></div>\n<br>\n<div><span style=\"color:#6796e6\">-</span><span style=\"color:#ccc\"> </span><span style=\"color:#569cd6;font-weight:bold\">紫水晶盔甲</span><span style=\"color:#ccc\">：充當動態光源。</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#ccc\"> 穿戴全套時，玩家周圍會持續發出亮度 15 的光線（真實燈籠效果）。</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#6796e6\">-</span><span style=\"color:#ccc\"> </span><span style=\"color:#569cd6;font-weight:bold\">綠寶石盔甲</span><span style=\"color:#ccc\">：獲得村民折扣。</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#ccc\"> 穿戴全套時，與村民交易可獲得更好價格，類似村莊英雄效果。</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#6796e6\">-</span><span style=\"color:#ccc\"> </span><span style=\"color:#569cd6;font-weight:bold\">黑曜石盔甲</span><span style=\"color:#ccc\">：獲得永久抗火效果。</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#ccc\"> 穿戴全套時，你將免疫所有火焰與熔岩傷害。</span></div>\n</div><div style=\"color:#ccc;background-color:#1f1f1f;font-family:Consolas, &amp;#x27;font-weight:normal;font-size:14px;line-height:19px\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"color:#ccc;background-color:#1f1f1f;font-family:Consolas, &amp;#x27;font-weight:normal;font-size:14px;line-height:19px\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"color:#ccc;background-color:#1f1f1f;font-family:Consolas, &amp;#x27;font-weight:normal;font-size:14px;line-height:19px\">\n<h2><span style=\"color:#569cd6;font-weight:bold\">自訂盾牌</span></h2>\n<span style=\"color:#ccc\">包含多種新型盾牌，如木製、鐵製、鑽石、綠寶石、黑曜石及特殊圓形變體。</span><br>\n<div><span style=\"color:#6796e6\">-</span><span style=\"color:#ccc\"> 每個盾牌都有獨特的格擋與裝備音效，提供更沉浸的戰鬥體驗。</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#6796e6\">-</span><span style=\"color:#ccc\"> 所有盾牌整齊收錄於專屬的創造模式標籤頁，方便取用。</span></div>\n<br>\n<h4><span style=\"color:#569cd6;font-weight:bold\">相容性</span></h4>\n<br>\n<div><span style=\"color:#ccc\">本模組已針對 Minecraft </span><span style=\"color:#569cd6;font-weight:bold\">26.1</span><span style=\"color:#ccc\"> 至 </span><span style=\"color:#569cd6;font-weight:bold\">26.2</span><span style=\"color:#ccc\"> 進行最佳化與完整測試。</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#ccc\">採用動態跨版本渲染系統，確保方塊輪廓與功能</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#ccc\">能透過單一 </span><span style=\"color:#ce9178\">`.jar`</span><span style=\"color:#ccc\"> 檔案在兩個版本上完美運作。</span></div>\n<br>\n<h4><span style=\"color:#569cd6;font-weight:bold\">需求</span></h4>\n<br>\n<div><span style=\"color:#6796e6\">-</span><span style=\"color:#ccc\"> </span><span style=\"color:#569cd6;font-weight:bold\">Fabric Loader</span><span style=\"color:#ccc\"> (&gt;=0.19.2)</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#6796e6\">-</span><span style=\"color:#ccc\"> </span><span style=\"color:#569cd6;font-weight:bold\">Fabric API</span><span style=\"color:#ccc\"> (&gt;= 0.145.1+26.1)</span></div>\n</div>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
